{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "b7a486d84795441ea444d8ab1f5b6f03", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "给团队写一封关于交付准时率的通知", "id": "1295225c16ed40b98abd8230a53de8e3", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:35.600964", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "556d20445bac4f2d875164d44588584b", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:35.600964"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "根据问题类型判断无需外部工具，直接基于已知信息作答。", "id": "937a9a95909d4d9fada8c0efc69a4d84", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:43.149830", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "各位同事：近期交付准时率有所波动，请各跟单重点关注：1）预测完工与承诺交期偏差>3天的订单须提前预警；2）高风险订单每日站会过一遍；3）发货前 3 天主动同步客户物流信息。本月目标：准时率恢复 95% 以上。", "id": "8676501552294dbfbdb7f5a129bca77b", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:43.149830", "finished_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:43.149830"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "39ba24f6e0bd437cb54e44b7bee50cf5", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:43.149830", "finished_at": "2026-06-19T16:21:43.149830"}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "新客户开售后备件清单怎么列", "id": "54dc0c3a77c24dc983bd48a153043a36", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:19.916167", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "f86c0762872748d5939096591f63e3ab", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:19.916167"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "分析用户诉求后，按要点组织答案，保持简洁准确。", "id": "2fe6c0bcd36d41cfaead1d5c6171ca88", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:26.815779", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "按机型列：制袋类（硅胶压板、加热管、切刀组件）、计量类（计量螺杆）、灌装类（机械密封）、装盒类（真空吸盘、气缸密封圈）、通用（光电开关、同步带）。建议随机附 3 个月用量，易损件备 2 套。", "id": "7f4b251cfd1147498faeaa17c813300b", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:26.815779", "finished_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:26.815779"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "262a0c986ec0465ba95ac3a8f0bce93f", "created_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:26.815779", "finished_at": "2026-06-19T16:24:26.815779"}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, 